{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510020/extras/862672a24be38816a9e81fb4fa1e428d.poster.avif?t=1767029335\" width=600 height=124 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510020/extras/862672a24be38816a9e81fb4fa1e428d.webm?t=1767029335\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510020/extras/862672a24be38816a9e81fb4fa1e428d.mp4?t=1767029335\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The second game from the creators of Placid Plastic Duck Simulator!<br><br>What started as a simple errand to another neighborhood has turned into a journey across land, sea, and air.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Zoi, a teenage girl on a mission to make it up to her best friend. To do that, you\u2019ll have to enter the regional card tournament and win the grand prize!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only problem is\u2026 well, you\u2019re not very good at cards. Or rather, you\u2019re really bad. Actually, you don\u2019t even know the rules!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But, you are determined.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fueled by the power of friendship, you'll explore exotic locations, meet memorable characters, play the card game, and challenge pro players to move forward\u2026 armed only with a deck of ducks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510020/extras/ede68f4725a188debfd8ee70e95f5a04.poster.avif?t=1767029335\" width=600 height=124 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510020/extras/ede68f4725a188debfd8ee70e95f5a04.webm?t=1767029335\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510020/extras/ede68f4725a188debfd8ee70e95f5a04.mp4?t=1767029335\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The universe of Placid Plastic Duck Simulator is expanding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ducks are going on an adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join them.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2510020?t=1767029335","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2510020?t=1767029335","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510020/daf69206b0f8c4285ff6d92b7b5bdc0c8c31623b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767029335","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510020/daf69206b0f8c4285ff6d92b7b5bdc0c8c31623b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767029335","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3790860,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>JOIN THE CHAT</h1><p></p><br><h1>Feature List</h1><p>- A blend of 2D and 3D graphics<br>- Themed decks and boards, each with its own personality<br>- Multiple-choice, branching dialogues<br>- Memorable and peculiar characters<br>- A heartfelt, story-rich adventure</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510020/extras/862672a24be38816a9e81fb4fa1e428d.poster.avif?t=1767029335\" width=600 height=124 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510020/extras/862672a24be38816a9e81fb4fa1e428d.webm?t=1767029335\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510020/extras/862672a24be38816a9e81fb4fa1e428d.mp4?t=1767029335\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The second game from the creators of Placid Plastic Duck Simulator!<br><br>What started as a simple errand to another neighborhood has turned into a journey across land, sea, and air.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Zoi, a teenage girl on a mission to make it up to her best friend. To do that, you\u2019ll have to enter the regional card tournament and win the grand prize!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only problem is\u2026 well, you\u2019re not very good at cards. Or rather, you\u2019re really bad. Actually, you don\u2019t even know the rules!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But, you are determined.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fueled by the power of friendship, you'll explore exotic locations, meet memorable characters, play the card game, and challenge pro players to move forward\u2026 armed only with a deck of ducks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510020/extras/ede68f4725a188debfd8ee70e95f5a04.poster.avif?t=1767029335\" width=600 height=124 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510020/extras/ede68f4725a188debfd8ee70e95f5a04.webm?t=1767029335\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510020/extras/ede68f4725a188debfd8ee70e95f5a04.mp4?t=1767029335\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The universe of Placid Plastic Duck Simulator is expanding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ducks are going on an adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join them.</p>","developers":["turbolento games","Fantastico Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510020/dccfe9468edba46a5335ebae5131c1e7087a4f9a/header.jpg?t=1767029335","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Placid Plastic Deck - A Quiet Quest \u00a92024. Published by turbolento games and Fantastico Studio. Developed by turbolento games and Fantastico Studio. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 10.12 Sierra<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGL 3.0<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 14 Sonoma<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple m2<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Apple m2<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2510020/830492553/0f69178f578fe4adb98c5708b8d95ec40188ffae/1759503054/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760695396","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2510020/830492553/0f69178f578fe4adb98c5708b8d95ec40188ffae/1759503054/dash_h264.mpd?t=1760695396","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2510020/830492553/0f69178f578fe4adb98c5708b8d95ec40188ffae/1759503054/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=